  UpgradeDescription: Prove your loyalty to Flock and start learning universal truths.
  UpgradeMechanicDescription: Raises puzzle rewards significantly.
  MascotDialogue: 'Nice!

    Did you expect me to say more? Nah, I wouldn''t waste
    a VIPs time.'
  AdText: GROW YOUR SPIRIT AND FINANCES
  OverrideDialogue:
  - OverrideDay: 1
    ReplacementDialogue: 'YOU <b>RANKED UP</b>!<n>

      I gift you many happy
      chirps and cheers from my tiny fledgling beak!<n>

      Oh, were you expecting
      a <b>challenge</b> when you bought that <b>new rank</b>?

      <c=Yes>Well,
      let me educate you then!

      <c=No>Ah, you must have read one of our pamphlets!<n>

      Within
      the <b><color=blue>FLOCK</color></b> orginization, there are two ways to progress.<n>

      You
      can raise through the <b>hierarchy</b> of the church and you can raise through
      the <b>hierarchy</b> of the business.<n>

      You need to do a <b>challenge</b>
      to get a <b>promotion</b>, but you only need to fill out some <b>paperwork</b>
      for a <b>new rank</b>.<n>

      However, we''ll let you skip the paperwork
      this time!<n>

      OH, AND I ALMOST FORGOT!<n>

      Every <b>rank</b>
      also gives you access to a new <b><color=blue>FLOCK</color></b> secret.<n>

      Your
      first <b>secret</b> is that...<n>

      Bird loves you. <3'
